<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty panel">正在读取详情...</view>

  <view wx:elif="{{item}}" class="detail">
    <view class="brand-header">
      <view class="round-action">←</view>
      <view class="brand-block">
        <view class="brand-title">详情</view>
        <view class="brand-subtitle">Item Details</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="detail-hero">
      <view class="detail-icon">＋</view>
      <view class="detail-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="detail-meta">
        <text>📍 {{item.campus}} · {{item.building}}</text>
        <text>📦 余量: {{item.quantity}}{{item.unit}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tags">
        <text class="tag">{{item.category}}</text>
        <text class="tag">{{item.distanceLabel}}</text>
        <text class="tag tag-alert">{{item.expireDate}} 到期</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="detail-desc">{{item.description}}</view>

    <view class="disclaimer-box">
      <text class="disclaimer-title">免责声明</text>
      平台仅做校园互助信息撮合，不介入线下交接。所有物品应为免费共享；请自行确认包装、有效期和适用风险；处方药、管控药物不允许发布或领取。
    </view>

    <view class="contact-card">
      <view wx:if="{{!contact}}" class="contact-hidden">
        <view class="contact-hint">为保护隐私，联系方式默认隐藏</view>
        <button class="reveal-btn" bindtap="revealContact">⌕ 查看联系方式</button>
      </view>

      <view wx:else class="contact-revealed">
        <view class="contact-title">联系方式</view>
        <view class="contact-row">微信：{{contact.wechat}}</view>
        <view class="contact-row">QQ：{{contact.qq}}</view>
        <view class="remaining">今日剩余查看次数：{{remaining}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
